{"id":"turm","lemma":"Turm","pos":"noun","rank":2954,"glosses":["tower, spire (very tall building or structure, especially with a tapering top)","steeple (tall tower on a church, normally topped with a spire)","rook (piece shaped like a castle tower)"],"ipa":"/tʊʁm/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/52/De-Turm.ogg/De-Turm.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Turmes","plural":"Türme"},"formAudio":{"Turmes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Turmes.wav","Türme":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-T%C3%BCrme.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wie hoch ist dieser Turm?","en":"How high is that tower?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/755187","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"high, tall"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Das ist ein Turm.","en":"That's a tower.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45438","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Wie kommt man auf den Turm?","en":"How do we get to the top of the tower?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Der Turm ist am Einstürzen.","en":"The tower is going to collapse.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"to collapse"}]},{"text":"Man kann den Turm von hier aus sehen.","en":"The tower can be seen from here.","words":[{"g":"one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"to see"}]}]}